BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"Go Figure" Art Exhibit and Opening Reception for Ria Blaas
DTSTART:20261106T170000
DTEND:20261106T190000
DTSTAMP:20261105T185042Z
UID:a46f0b3d1744a84f58e9bef7fc3ee3@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:“Go Figure” Exhibition of Sculptures and Paintings by RIA 
 BLAAS November 5\, 2026 through January 31\, 2027 Born in Rotterdam\, the 
 Netherlands\, sculptor Ria Blaas was classically trained in the European t
 radition. She received her training at the Academy of Art in Breda and the
  Royal Academy of Art in Amsterdam and first visited Vermont in 1981 befor
 e moving there permanently in 1987. She has exhibited throughout New Engla
 nd and teaches workshops\, classes\, and leads residencies. Blaas's curren
 t work embraces exploration: she chisels\, burns\, and chainsaws wood to r
 emove material and discover the form within. Just as wind and water can er
 ode wood over time to a polished\, stone-like surface\, Blaas chooses how 
 to expose the wood's surface — creating scarred\, polished\, and multifa
 ceted textures that engage the viewer. Some of her larger-than-life sculpt
 ures are placed within the landscape\, engaging with and becoming part of 
 the natural world\; others are in dialogue with internal spaces. Opening R
 eception Friday\, November 6\, 2026\, from 5 to 7 PM Artist Talk Friday\, 
 December 4 from 5to 6 PM\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Gate Street Gallery\, 79 Gates Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/go-figure-
 art-exhibit-and-opening-reception-for-ria-blaas-19-10-2026-21-19-29
END:VEVENT
