BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Vermont Maple Conference
DTSTART:20261108T083000
DTEND:20261108T154500
DTSTAMP:20261105T185042Z
UID:041a480e754ee48bbebe28928f84e1@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join Vermont’s maple community for three days of learning\, 
 connection\, and hands-on experiences at the 2026 Vermont Maple Conference
 \, presented by the Vermont Maple Sugar Makers’ Association and Universi
 ty of Vermont Extension. This year’s conference brings together maple pr
 oducers\, researchers\, industry professionals\, landowners\, and anyone i
 nterested in maple production for educational programs designed for operat
 ions of all sizes and experience levels. Friday\, November 6 – Maple Qua
 lity School Build your maple quality knowledge through hands-on education 
 focused on producing\, grading\, and maintaining high-quality maple syrup.
  Saturday\, November 7 – Vermont Maple Conference Day Gather for a full 
 day of educational sessions\, industry updates\, research\, practical prod
 uction information\, and opportunities to connect with Vermont’s maple c
 ommunity. Maple Sugarhouse Bus Tours Sunday\, November 8 – Hit the road 
 to visit working Vermont sugarhouses\, meet fellow producers\, and see map
 le production practices\, equipment\, and operations firsthand. Participan
 ts can register for the conference activities that best fit their interest
